000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. SEARCH1.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  COLOR-LIST     PIC X(24)
000060                    VALUE "RED   GREEN BLUE  YELLOW".
000070 01  COLOR-TABLE REDEFINES COLOR-LIST.
000080     05  COLOR-NAME PIC X(6) OCCURS 4 TIMES
000090                    INDEXED BY CX.
